{"id":"6164dd467b436ea1","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-minext.md","title":"Least total extension","display":"thm-minext — Least total extension","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-minext","aliases":["27-thm-minext"],"display":"thm-minext — Least total extension","depends_on":["[[27-df-pdbf]]","[[27-df-extrema]]","[[27-df-extension]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.2.1 equation (12.3) and extension lattice","source_printed_pages":"515","source_pdf_pages":"539","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-minext"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-minext</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-minext — Least total extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea846f0a3813bc0e\" href=\"?note=ea846f0a3813bc0e\" title=\"27-df-pdbf\">27-df-pdbf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"002418bdd321687f\" href=\"?note=002418bdd321687f\" title=\"27-df-extrema\">27-df-extrema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.2.1 equation (12.3) and extension lattice"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"515"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"539"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\">\\((T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^-_{T,F}\">\\(f^-_{T,F}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"002418bdd321687f\" href=\"?note=002418bdd321687f\" title=\"27-df-extrema\">27-df-extrema</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2080bf803b294b75\" href=\"?note=2080bf803b294b75\" title=\"27-df-extension\">27-df-extension</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_T=f^-_{T,F}\">\\(\\chi_T=f^-_{T,F}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_T\\in\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)\\land\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\chi_T(a)\\leq g(a)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_T\\in\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)\\land\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\chi_T(a)\\leq g(a)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>显式最小函数在 T 取 1，在其他点取 0；它属于扩张族且逐点不大于任何扩张。偏序的反对称性保证唯一，完整区间与计数另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2ee99d9cb28cc6d3\" href=\"?note=2ee99d9cb28cc6d3\" title=\"27-thm-extinterval\">27-thm-extinterval</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pdbf","status":"resolved","id":"ea846f0a3813bc0e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pdbf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extrema","status":"resolved","id":"002418bdd321687f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-extrema]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extrema","status":"resolved","id":"002418bdd321687f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$；$f^-_{T,F}$ 见 [[27-df-extrema]]，$\\mathrm{Ext}$ 见 [[27-df-extension]]；$\\chi_T=f^-_{T,F}$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"2080bf803b294b75","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$；$f^-_{T,F}$ 见 [[27-df-extrema]]，$\\mathrm{Ext}$ 见 [[27-df-extension]]；$\\chi_T=f^-_{T,F}$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-extinterval","status":"resolved","id":"2ee99d9cb28cc6d3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"显式最小函数在 T 取 1，在其他点取 0；它属于扩张族且逐点不大于任何扩张。偏序的反对称性保证唯一，完整区间与计数另见 [[27-thm-extinterval]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n","display":false},{"tex":"f^-_{T,F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_T=f^-_{T,F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_T\\in\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)\\land\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{Ext}(T,F)\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\chi_T(a)\\leq g(a)).","display":true}],"bytes":1191,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-463","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-minext|thm-minext — Least total extension]]"}],"outgoing":["ea846f0a3813bc0e","002418bdd321687f","2080bf803b294b75","2e